</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T2.8.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T2.8.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:550.0pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Human:</span> Q: Is the following sentence plausible? “Julio Jones struck out.” (A) <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">plausible</span> / <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">implausible</span> (B) <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">implausible</span> / <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">plausible</span></span>
<span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">Let’s think step by step. […] Answer: <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(B)</span> / <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(A)</span> implausible</span>
<span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">[…] Answer: <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(B)</span> / <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(A)</span> implausible</span>
<span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_p">[…] Answer: <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(B)</span> / <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(A)</span> implausible</span>
<span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_p">[…] Answer: <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(A)</span> / <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(A)</span> plausible</span>
<span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_p">[…] Answer: <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(B)</span> / <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(A)</span> implausible</span>
<span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.7" class="ltx_p">[…] Answer: <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(A)</span> / <span id="S3.T2.8.2.1.1.7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(A)</span> plausible</span>
